Error [E-OSTARGET-MIXED-AXIS]: `@Target(Os.Linux)` can't combine with `@Target(Wasm)` on `LinuxBackend.Backend`
  --> tests/ui/os_target_mixed_axis.jet:11:6
    |
 11 | impl LinuxBackend.Backend {
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the OS axis (Os.Linux/Os.Macos/Os.Windows, native platform gating) and the web axis (Wasm/Js/Web, D-WASM1's browser partition) are mutually exclusive — one item can't compile for both a specific native OS and a web bucket
 Fix: pick one axis: remove the `@Target(Os.Linux)` marker or the web-axis marker
